  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Business training for young people in San Juan de Lurigancho</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EDUCA is a development NGO that seeks to improve the quality of education in Peru on a basis of equity.  It treats girls, boys and young people as active participants in education, and works with teaching staff, parents and local, regional and national institutions, public and private, committed to the development of education in Peru. Through business training with young people in the town of San Juan de Lurigancho EDUCA hold workshops on business management, marketing and legal requirements that young people use to set up their own business. The partner provides support and accompaniment for the youth they have put through their training programme. EDUCA also work with the local government so that the municipality and the local community can see the value of engaging with young people and the potential benefits of offering them support.</narrative>
  </description>
